  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(a)&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\st0042_251a9e6e33c7.png\" style=\"width: 94px; height: 119px;\" />Caprolactum is the monomeric&nbsp;unit of polymer Nylon<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math>.</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></math>Chlorobuta<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></math>diene is the monomeric unit of polymer neoprene.<br />(c) Isoprene is the monomeric unit of polymer natural rubber.<br />(d) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>CN</mi></math> (Acrylonitrile) is one of the monomeric unit of polymer&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Buna</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>.</p>"
